/span> </div> <p class="apreciere-text" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>"Modelajul de baloane sub formă de săbii și animale a adus multă bucurie tuturor copiilor prezenți."</p> </div><div class="apreciere-item" data-review-id="rev_006" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <div class="apreciere-head" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <div class="apreciere-avatar" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <img src="/images/avatars/avatar_006.jpg" alt="Ioana S." width="44" height="44" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> </div> <div class="apreciere-info" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <h4 class="apreciere-nume" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>Ioana S.</h4> <span class="apreciere-data" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>Acum 6 ani</span> </div> <div class="apreciere-status" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="12" height="12" stroke-width="2.5" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62></path> </svg> <span data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>Verificat</span> </div> </div> <div class="apreciere-stele" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <span class="r-star" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>★</span><span class="r-star" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>★</span><span class="r-star" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>★</span><span class="r-star" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>★</span><span class="r-star" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>★</span> </div> <p class="apreciere-text" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62>"Mini-disco plin de energie, copiii au dansat și s-au distrat pe cinste cu animatoarea preferată."</p> </div><div class="apreciere-item" data-review-id="rev_007" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <div class="apreciere-head" data-astro-cid-rmfhop62> <div class="apreciere-avatar" data-astro-ci